<!--
=============================================================================
XML SITEMAP - Search Engine Site Structure Map for Isaia Riva Portfolio
=============================================================================

This sitemap tells search engines about all the important pages on the website,
when they were last updated, how often they change, and their relative importance.
It helps Google, Bing, and other search engines efficiently crawl and index the site.

Sitemap Protocol: https://www.sitemaps.org/protocol.html
Google's Guide: https://developers.google.com/search/docs/crawling-indexing/sitemaps

Site Details:
- Owner: Isaia Riva (Senior Front End Developer)  
- Canonical Domain: https://www.isaiariva.com
- Hosting: Railway (monorepoonfire.up.railway.app)
- Target Keywords: "Isaia Riva", "Riva Isaia", "Senior Front End Developer"
- Last Updated: 2025-10-22

XML Elements Explained:
- <loc>: The URL of the page (must be canonical domain for SEO)
- <lastmod>: When the page was last modified (YYYY-MM-DD format)
- <changefreq>: How often the page content typically changes
- <priority>: Relative importance compared to other pages (0.0 to 1.0)

Priority Guidelines:
- 1.0 = Homepage (most important)
- 0.8-0.9 = Main sections (about, contact, portfolio)
- 0.5-0.7 = Individual projects/articles
- 0.1-0.4 = Less important pages (legal, archives)

Change Frequency Options:
- always, hourly, daily, weekly, monthly, yearly, never
-->

<urlset xmlns="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9">
  
  <!--
  ============================================================================= 
  HOMEPAGE - Primary Landing Page for Isaia Riva Portfolio
  =============================================================================
  This is the most important page for SEO and user discovery.
  Contains main introduction, skills overview, and featured projects.
  
  SEO Importance: Maximum (1.0) - This is what people see first when searching
  Update Frequency: Weekly - Content may be updated with new projects/info
  Target Keywords: "Isaia Riva", "Riva Isaia", "Senior Front End Developer Portfolio"
  -->
  <url>
    <loc>https://www.isaiariva.com/</loc>
    <lastmod>2025-10-22</lastmod>
    <changefreq>weekly</changefreq>
    <priority>1.0</priority>
  </url>
  
  <!--
  ============================================================================= 
  CONTACT PAGE - Professional Contact Information
  =============================================================================
  Essential for potential employers and clients to reach Isaia Riva.
  Contains contact form, email, social media links, and professional info.
  
  SEO Importance: High (0.8) - Important for business inquiries and networking
  Update Frequency: Monthly - Contact info changes less frequently than portfolio
  Target Keywords: "Contact Isaia Riva", "Hire Senior Front End Developer"
  
  Business Value: Critical for converting visitors to leads/opportunities
  -->
  <url>
    <loc>https://www.isaiariva.com/contact</loc>
    <lastmod>2025-10-22</lastmod>
    <changefreq>monthly</changefreq>
    <priority>0.8</priority>
  </url>
  
</urlset>

